{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0066-s001", "text": "I skolorna i Finland, liksom i arbetslivet i Finland, är hierarkin låg.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-grundskola/narration/resume-20261103T034126635812+0000-4/hb-c08-u0066-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.6873469387755105, "peak": 0.312103271484375, "generation_seconds": 29.17347093205899, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0066-s002", "text": "Lärarna och skolans rektor är lättillgängliga för både eleverna och föräldrarna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-grundskola/narration/resume-20261103T034126635812+0000-4/hb-c08-u0066-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.174965986394557, "peak": 0.332244873046875, "generation_seconds": 26.98032699106261, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0066-s003", "text": "Rektorn är skolans pedagogiska ledare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-grundskola/narration/resume-20261103T034126635812+0000-4/hb-c08-u0066-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.7616326530612243, "peak": 0.278778076171875, "generation_seconds": 14.975827265065163, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0066-s004", "text": "Också hen har lärarutbildning och tidigare erfarenhet av att arbeta som lärare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-grundskola/narration/resume-20261103T034126635812+0000-4/hb-c08-u0066-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.035646258503402, "peak": 0.357330322265625, "generation_seconds": 23.5713084009476, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0066-s005", "text": "Barnet deltar i utvärderingssamtal om skolarbetet som hålls mellan läraren och föräldrarna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-grundskola/narration/resume-20261103T034126635812+0000-4/hb-c08-u0066-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.219863945578231, "peak": 0.27099609375, "generation_seconds": 30.364031543023884, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
